  "statuteText": "674:8 Consideration by Mayor and Budget Committee. –\n\nWhenever the planning board or the capital improvement program committee has prepared a capital improvements program under RSA 674:7, it shall submit its recommendations for the current year to the mayor or selectmen and the budget committee, if one exists, for consideration as part of the annual budget."
